@startuml

title EduSurvey - Complete Survey

actor Student
participant "EduSurvey" as System
database "Database" as DB

Student -> System: Sign in
System -> DB: Verify student account
DB --> System: Account verified
System --> Student: Display available surveys

Student -> System: Select survey
System -> DB: Get survey questions
DB --> System: Return survey questions
System --> Student: Display survey

Student -> System: Submit answers
System -> System: Validate answers

alt Answers are valid
    System -> DB: Save survey response
    DB --> System: Response saved
    System --> Student: Show submission confirmation

else Answers are invalid or incomplete
    System --> Student: Show validation error
    Student -> System: Correct answers
    Student -> System: Submit answers again
    System -> DB: Save survey response
    DB --> System: Response saved
    System --> Student: Show submission confirmation
end

@enduml
